              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaadka la subki doono oo quduus looga dhigi doono inuu wadaad ka ahaado meeshii aabbihiis ayaa kafaaraggudka samayn doona, oo isagaa xidhan doona dharka wanaagsan oo linenka ah, oo ah dharka quduuska ah. ",
          "type": "text",
