              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagu waa inuu kafaaraggud u sameeyaa meesha quduuska ah, waana inuu kafaaraggud u sameeyaa teendhada shirka iyo meesha allabariga, oo waa inuu kafaaraggud u sameeyaa wadaaddada iyo dadka shirka oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
